  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>253</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;(where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;22</mo></math>&nbsp;is any positive integer), is"
  },
