  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>253</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Using the binomial expansion&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>,</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mspace></mspace><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mspace></mspace><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mspace></mspace><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mspace></mspace><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />As&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>5</mn> <mn>3</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>3</mn> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, also <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;22</mo></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> </mrow> </math>Coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>1012</mn></msup></math> will come only from the first term, i.e. in</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mspace></mspace><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>253</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p>The general term in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p>Hence, the&nbsp;general term in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>253</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>253</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>253</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1012</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>253</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Thus, the required coefficient is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mspace/><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
